    // Hardcoded UI text: every visible or spoken string comes from next-intl. jsx-no-literals
    // covers text children; the eauxle/ui-text selectors cover string literals in the props that
    // carry text and toast calls (a rule of its own, so the lists above that override each other
    // cannot drop it). allowedStrings holds punctuation and symbols that are not language.
    {
      "files": ["**/*.tsx"],
